sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    actor Staff as PER-056 (Branch Staff)
    participant Retail as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant Compliance as SVC-015<br/>Compliance Core
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-134 — Cash Deposit Receipt and AML Threshold Reporting

    Customer->>Staff: Present £12,000 cash for deposit; provide ID
    Note right of Staff: Verify customer identity (CDD)<br/>Count and verify cash via machine
    Staff->>Retail: POST /branch/cash-deposits {amount: 12000, cash_count_verified: true}
    Note right of Retail: Create CashDepositTransaction<br/>Amount 12000 > 10000 → aml_threshold_exceeded: true<br/>Generate aml_report_ref
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish CashDepositAboveThreshold (EVT-166)
    EventBus->>Compliance: Consume EVT-166 → Queue AML report for MLRO review
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-166 → Write immutable AML threshold record

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-135 — Account Credit and Vault Reconciliation

    Note right of Retail: Credit customer account<br/>Status → credited
    Retail-->>Staff: 201 Created {credited, aml_threshold_exceeded: true, aml_report_ref}
    Staff-->>Customer: Issue deposit receipt
    Staff->>Retail: End of day: vault cash reconciliation
    Retail-->>Staff: Vault reconciled; surplus prepared for cash centre
